Sheets
Sheet	One row per	Columns	Module
gen_ai.system_instructions	part	traceId, spanId, position, type, content	system_instructions
gen_ai.tool.definitions	tool	traceId, spanId, position, type, name, description	tool_definitions
gen_ai.tool.definitions parameters	node of a tool's parameters	traceId, spanId, tool position, node, parent node, name, value	tool_definitions
gen_ai.input.messages	message	traceId, spanId, position, role, name	messages
gen_ai.input.messages parts	part	traceId, spanId, message position, position, type, content, id, name, mime_type, modality, file_id, uri	messages
gen_ai.output.messages	message	traceId, spanId, position, role, name, finish_reason	messages
gen_ai.output.messages parts	part	traceId, spanId, message position, position, type, content, id, name, mime_type, modality, file_id, uri	messages
part values	node of a part's arguments, response or server tool call	traceId, spanId, message position, part position, node, parent node, name, value	messages
gen_ai.tool.call.arguments	node	traceId, spanId, node, parent node, name, value	tool_calls
gen_ai.tool.call.result	node	traceId, spanId, node, parent node, name, value	tool_calls
gen_ai.memory.records	memory record	traceId, spanId, position, id, score	memory_records
gen_ai.memory.records values	node of a record's content or metadata	traceId, spanId, record position, node, parent node, name, value	memory_records
gen_ai.retrieval.documents	document	traceId, spanId, position, id, score	retrieval_documents
Open
Item	What is undecided	Where
key and position names	the column names above for position, node and parent node	Integrations › sheet and column names
text holding HT, LF, FF or CR	atomic to Codd, out of scope in the MTSV draft: to settle at the MTSV level	Integrations › text values
log records without ids	their key is their position in the file	Integrations › relations
numbers as written	kept as the source writes them, by analogy	Integrations › numbers
properties beyond a schema	each goes to its object's value sheet	Integrations › nonsimple values
three rows cite code blocks	a register converter that splits .proto, .json and .yaml would let them point exactly	Register
spec file	its name and format	Tree
conformance case layout	file names; whether cases also exist that must be refused	Tree
.jsonl line endings	the .gitattributes row names .mtsv and .json only	Tree
library interface	the call names, following the Interfaces rows	Modules
command	its name and options, following the Interfaces rows	Modules
this record	its name, and no register row places it	Tree
